    "description": "Something’s Brewing 0.0\n\nA gentle opening into Shoonya’s Alchemy Center\nA high-tea wellness ritual like never before\n\nSunday | 18.01.2026 | 3.30 PM – 7.00 PM | Limited Spots\n\n(registrations open at 8 PM IST) \n\nWhat to expect?\n\n• A guided herbal tea ritual designed by our in-house alchemist, Gravit, inviting you closer to your true nature\n\n• Learning the art of intention setting, so our desires begin to shape reality with clarity\n\n• Our signature tea blend Shānti, offered as part of this introductory experience to sip and unwind\n\n• A curated gourmet bakery menu made with wholesome, organic, and consciously sourced ingredients, available to order at your own pace\n\nWho is this for?\n\n• Friends, couples, or solo seekers looking for a detox and a mindful pause\n\n• Those craving community, connection, and meaningful conversations\n\n• Those seeking a cozy, nourishing way to spend a Sunday\n\n• Those exploring alternatives to conventional social spaces\n\nA note from Shoonya World\n\nWe are a conscious living ecosystem.\nThis intention forms the ground for everything that unfolds at Shoonya World.\nCome as you are.\nLeave a little lighter.",
